# <<< buildflow-managed (.gitignore) <<<

# Keep the reports/ directory present on fresh clones. BuildFlow's
# test-coverage step writes reports/coverage.out and fails if the directory is
# missing. The managed block above ignores reports/ wholesale, so re-include
# the directory itself, ignore its contents, then keep only the marker file.
!reports/
reports/*
!reports/.gitkeep
/naked-return-guard
